sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
# one sender, fragmented messages, two recipients
send m1 alice rx Hello from alice, this body needs two fragments.
send m2 alice ny Short note.
send m3 bob tokyo prio=high Status report: all systems nominal.
advance 5s
inbox rx
inbox tokyo
show m1
history m3
now
